        {
          "t": "raw",
          "html": "<h2>Where do I start?</h2><p>If you do not know your first step yet, go in this order. All three steps are free, and none of them makes you our client.</p><ol class=\"art-path-list\"><li class=\"art-path-row\"><span class=\"art-path-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"art-path-body\"><h3>Write the scope</h3><p>With the third article’s template, fix your project on one page of paper, even if you never work with us.</p></span><a class=\"art-path-link\" href=\"/en/articles/project-scope/\">Read the scope template →</a></li><li class=\"art-path-row\"><span class=\"art-path-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"art-path-body\"><h3>Get a number</h3><p>The project estimator gives you a brief and a rough range in minutes, based on the features you pick.</p></span><a class=\"art-path-link\" href=\"/en/tools/estimator/\">Project estimator →</a></li><li class=\"art-path-row\"><span class=\"art-path-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"art-path-body\"><h3>Check your security</h3><p>The free security self check shows where your current site or system is exposed, before it is too late.</p></span><a class=\"art-path-link\" href=\"/en/tools/security-check/\">Start the self check →</a></li></ol>",
          "class": "",
          "tag": "div"
        }
      ]
    }
